  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 77be8d3abc4d614408c62dfb3862c314, type: 3}
  m_Name: J1_Seq2_A_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SpeakerTextSO
  showScore: 1
  dialogues:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: 'Pros: your internal teams time is free to review other important project
      matters (lofistics, supply chain, H&S etc.) which will increase the tender
      return quality. The client''s satisfation increases due to your attention to
      detail. There was a cost to your profit, but it was minimal.'
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: 'Cons: your internal team has spent less time reviewing the scope of works
      and drawings themselves. During construction phase this puts them at risk of
      not being as on top of the project requirements and costly mistakes can occur
      as a result. As your team hired a non-specialist bill of quantities contractor
      some areas of Scope may have been missed which your team are also not aware
      of. Your profit is put at risk as a result, and this could come back to bite
      you during construction phase...'
